      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Keywords per experience: every skill keyword found in its\nlines (same matching as db_sync: whole words, today's skills\ntable; set-aside skills left out). Green = asked by your\npostings, blue = known. The expanded line shows its own. Some\nare noise (e.g. 'french' from 'French state-supported\nmarketplace'): fix with Set aside or a merge.",
      "roughness": 1,
      "roundness": null,
