      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "opacity": 100,
      "originalText": "Summary review: your Name / Fame / Aim prompt, run by Haiku,\nwith no target role on the master resume (a job's target role\nis passed when a job is reviewed). Scores 0–2 (Aim may be\nn/a), a quote per score, clarity with a one-sentence\npositioning, and revision requests. Ready only if Name and\nFame are 2, Aim 2 or n/a, clarity passes; the code checks that\nrule and the quotes. Re-score runs it again.",
